flowchart TD
    box_0(["Start"])
    box_1["Stop the machine immediately. Manually remove the<br/>jammed part without forcing. Inspect the part and<br/>the reorientation unit interior for damage or<br/>debris. Note the jam location."]
    box_2{"Is the jammed part dimensionally non conforming<br/>(outside the accepted dimensional range for this<br/>product type)?"}
    box_3["Measure the jammed part on the metrology station.<br/>Record dimensions."]
    box_4["Reject the current batch and reload from a<br/>dimensionally confirmed batch. Notify quality<br/>assurance team and create a non conformance record."]
    box_5{"Is there contamination or debris in the<br/>reorientation unit that could obstruct part<br/>movement?"}
    box_6["Inspect the reorientation unit interior, guide<br/>channels, and gripper faces for dust accumulation,<br/>adhesive residue, or foreign material."]
    box_7["Clean the reorientation unit interior and gripper<br/>faces with a lint free cloth and compressed air.<br/>Verify that all guide channels are clear."]
    box_8{"Is the gripper jaw opening width correctly set for<br/>this part diameter?"}
    box_9["Complete the following checks: 1. Measure gripper<br/>jaw opening width with a digital caliper. 2. Compare<br/>the measured width against the specified value for<br/>this part type. 3. Check whether the jaw stop<br/>adjuster is secure and correctly positioned."]
    box_10["Adjust the gripper jaw opening to the specified<br/>clearance for the current product type. reverify<br/>with a manual jog cycle before resuming."]
    box_11{"Is the reorientation cycle completing within the<br/>specified cycle time?"}
    box_12["Time three consecutive reorientation cycles using<br/>the cycle timer on the operator control interface<br/>and compare against the maximum cycle time<br/>specification."]
    box_13["Check the reorientation drive motor current and<br/>servomotor settings for the rotation axis. Reduce<br/>speed or increase torque limit if the drive is not<br/>completing the cycle within the specification."]
    box_14{"Has the jam fault been eliminated and ten<br/>consecutive jam free cycles confirmed?"}
    box_15["Escalate to the maintenance team: repeated jams in<br/>the reorientation unit indicate a mechanical fault<br/>requiring detailed inspection of the rotation<br/>bearing and drive mechanism."]
    box_16["Record the jam event, root cause, and corrective<br/>action in the quality log. Notify quality assurance<br/>team."]
    box_17["Run 20 cycle production speed verification, monitor<br/>reorientation unit for jam recurrence."]
    box_18[/"Refer to the reorientation unit cycle verification<br/>criteria."/]
    box_19{"All 20 cycles completed without jam or cycle<br/>timeout?"}
    box_20(["End, Escalate: jam recurring in verification run,<br/>mechanical inspection required"])
    box_21{"Was the jammed part damaged, could it have been<br/>released downstream before jam detection?"}
    box_22["Trace and quarantine any parts from the fault window<br/>in downstream stations."]
    box_23(["End, Procedure complete. Production resumed."])

